\u7853\'3ft t\'fd), c\'f3 ph\'e1t sinh ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 \'f0\u7873\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, bao g\u7891\'3fm:
