\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af383 \ltrch\fcs0 \f383\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 C\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh doanh th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp cung \u7913\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd \'e3n u\u7889\'3fng, d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f, c\'e1c ng\'e0nh h
\'e0ng kh\'f4ng, \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng s\u7855\'3ft, \'f0\'fd\u7901\'3fng bi\u7875\'3fn, du l\u7883\'3fch, c\'f3 b\'e1n h\'e0ng ho\'e1, v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd cao h\'f5n gi\'e1 ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo nh\u7853\'3fp kho \'f0\u7873\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi n
\u7897\'3fp kho\u7843\'3fn ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, bao g\u7891\'3fm:
\par - Ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 b\'e1n h\'e0ng ho\'e1, v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd theo gi\'e1 l\u7867\'3f nh\'fd: x\'e3ng d\u7847\'3fu, s\u7855\'3ft th\'e9p, xi m\'e3ng, g\u7895\'3f ...
