\u7889\'3fng, d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c ng\'e0nh c\'f3 b\'e1n h\'e0ng c\'f4ng ngh\u7879\'3f ph\u7849\'3fm v\'e0 th\u7921\'3fc ph\u7849\'3fm c\'f4ng ngh\u7879\'3f v\u7899\'3fi gi\'e1 cao h\'f5n gi\'e1 ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo nh
\u7853\'3fp kho.
\par - Ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 \u7903\'3f c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh doanh th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, qu\u7853\'3fn, huy\u7879\'3fn b\'e1n h\'e0ng v\u7899\'3f
i gi\'e1 cao h\'f5n gi\'e1 ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo nh\u7853\'3fp kho.
\par - Ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 \u7903\'3f c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc kinh doanh theo gi\'e1 tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn, do gi\'e1 b\'e1n th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f cao h\'f5n gi\'e1 v\u7889\'3fn (gi\'e1 mua + chi ph\'ed l\'fd
u th\'f4ng v\'e0 l\u7907\'3fi nhu\u7853\'3fn \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc).
\par C\'f4ng th\u7913\'3fc t\'ednh ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 \u7903\'3f kh\'e2u b\'e1n nh\'fd sau:
