\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 1. K\'ea khai ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 ph\'e1t sinh khi nh\u7853\'3fp kho h\'e0ng ho\'e1
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af383 \ltrch\fcs0 \f383\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 M\u7895\'3fi khi nh\u7853\'3fp kho h\'e0ng ho\'e1, k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n ph\u7843\'3fi c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o h\'e0ng ho\'e1 \'f0\'f5n mua h\'e0ng ki\'eam phi\u7871\'3fu nh
\u7853\'3fp kho \'f0\u7875\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh kho\u7843\'3fn ngay t\'ean t\u7915\'3fng ho\'e1 \'f0\'f5n kho\u7843\'3fn ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0 ph\u7843\'3fi b\'f9. \'d0\u7883\'3fnh k\u7923\'3f 10 ng\'e0y 1 l\u7847
\'3fn, k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n l\u7853\'3fp b\u7843\'3fn k\'ea n\u7897\'3fp ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 (sau khi }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af375 \ltrch\fcs0 \f375\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 \'e3 tr\u7915\'3f s\u7889\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi b\'f9), l\'e0m t\u7901\'3f khai ki\'eam u\u7927\'3f nhi\'eamj chi n\u7897\'3fp NSNN, g\u7917\'3fi Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp. C
}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af383 \ltrch\fcs0 \f383\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 \'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o gi\u7845\'3fy n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn, ng\'e2n h\'e0ng tr\'edch n\u7897\'3fp kho\u7843\'3fn ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1
ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 2. K\'ea khai ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 ph\'e1t sinh khi h\'e0ng ho\'e1 b\'e1n ra
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af383 \ltrch\fcs0 \f383\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0 b\'e1o c\'e1o b\'e1n h\'e0ng, k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp. \'d0\u7883\'3f
nh k\u7923\'3f 5 ho\u7863\'3fc 10 ng\'e0y k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n l\u7853\'3fp b\u7843\'3fng k\'ea n\u7897\'3fp ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 v\'e0 l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc tr\'edch n\u7897\'3fp ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 g\u7917\'3fi ng\'e2n h\'e0
ng ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp. C\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o ti\u7873\'3fn, ng\'e2n h\'e0ng tr\'edch n\u7897\'3fp kho\u7843\'3fn ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f m\u7863\'3ft h\'e0ng nh\'fd: s\u7855\'3ft th\'e9p, x\'e3ng d\u7847\'3fu, xi m\'e3ng, bia h\'f5i ... m\u7913\'3fc ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 h\'e0ng k\'ea n\u7897\'3fp cho t\u7915\'3fng m\u7863\'3f
t h\'e0ng c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f. \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f...... nhi\u7873\'3fu m\u7863\'3ft h\'e0ng ph\u7913\'3fc t\u7841\'3fp c\'f3 ph\'e1t sinh ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch  th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 \'ec s\u7889\'3f ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o... c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af383 \ltrch\fcs0 \f383\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778  tr\'edch n\u7897\'3fp theo s\u7889
\'3f th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f ph\'e1t sinh, ho\u7863\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\'edch n\u7897\'3fp theo t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f tr\'ean doanh s\u7889\'3f b\'e1n th\u7921\'3fc thu v\'e0 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ch\u7881\'3fnh theo quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n th\u7921
\'3fc t\u7871\'3f. T\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f (%) n\u7897\'3fp ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'f5 quan t\'e0i ch\'ednh c\'f9ng c\u7845\'3fp x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0 th\'f4ng b\'e1o cho ng\'e2
n h\'e0ng ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f x\'ed}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778  nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af383 \ltrch\fcs0 \f383\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh doanh theo gi\'e1 tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn, \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e9p b\'f9 tr
\u7915\'3f ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 ph\u7843\'3fi thu, ph\u7843\'3fi b\'f9 v\'e0 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc gi\u7919\'3f l\u7841\'3fi kh\'f4ng qu\'e1 20% t\u7893\'3fng s\u7889\'3f ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 ph\'e1t sinh \'f0\u7875\'3f b\u7893\'3f sung qu
\u7929\'3f khuy\u7871\'3fn kh\'edch ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh (b\u7893\'3f sung v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng t\u7921\'3f c\'f3). Kho\u7843\'3fn ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn c}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 \'f2n l\u7841\'3fi }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af383 \ltrch\fcs0 \f383\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1267181\charrsid3819778 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o NSNN theo k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v
\'e0 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ch\u7881\'3fnh theo th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qc \li0\ri0\keepn\widctlpar\tx1251\tx1971\tx2691\tx3411\tx4131\tx4851\tx5571\tx6291\tx7011\tx7731\tx8451\tx9171\tx9891\tx10611\tx11331\tx12051\wrapdefault\faauto\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13838175 {\rtlch\fcs1 
